    <id>collaborativephotocleanup</id>
    <name>PhotoCleanup</name>
    <summary>Collaborative photo review, voting, and cleanup</summary>
    <description>Collaborative photo review, voting, and cleanup for Nextcloud. Teams can collectively decide which photos to keep and which to delete. Features include perceptual hash (pHash) duplicate detection, cluster-based review with swipe gestures, a quarantine system for safe deletion, PWA support for mobile, and configurable voting thresholds. Exclusively vibe coded.</description>
